[README.txt]
File includes data collected for each individual for three species Acacia Chundra, Chloroxylon swietenia
and Gardenia gummifera sampled in 2009 and 2016.
Data includes: 
'State'  whether tree or sprout; 
'survival': probability of survival of an individual in 2016;
'size' : Sizes in 2009 and 2016 represented in diameter;
'sprout2016' : probability of an individual to transition from tree state to sprout state;
'harvest' : presence and absence of harvesting observed on an individual
